1
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:12,000
Mosaic turns small acts of kindness into one artwork a group reveals together—without rankings, likes, or larger tiles for paying users.

2
00:00:12,000 --> 00:00:30,000
Participants are always free. Every contribution receives equal weight, while a free organizer can run one unrevealed Mosaic.

3
00:00:30,000 --> 00:00:48,000
Members join privately, choose an act, and share a sealed disposable roll. Attribution and reveal access never depend on payment.

4
00:00:48,000 --> 00:01:03,000
Organizer Plus makes room for larger groups: up to 100 tiles, 36 shots per member, every film look, and multiple active Mosaics.

5
00:01:03,000 --> 00:01:21,000
These localized options come from RevenueCat. Annual and monthly unlock Plus; a one-event pass grants one server-tracked PASS.

6
00:01:21,000 --> 00:01:34,000
The client never authorizes itself. Supabase reconciles RevenueCat API version 2 before premium controls unlock.

7
00:01:34,000 --> 00:01:46,000
The new Mosaic captures premium access permanently, so a future expiry can block new premium events without damaging this one.

8
00:01:46,000 --> 00:01:50,000
Mosaic is student-built, open source, and ready for Next Gen.
